###> lexik/jwt-authentication-bundle ###
# The passphrase is written to .env.test.local by `make jwt-keys` alongside the keys.
# It is deliberately absent here: a committed passphrase is a committed secret, and the
# one that used to live here was the real one protecting config/jwt/private.pem.
